College Bookstore & Stationery Pre-Order System
Build a Flask web application that lets students browse and pre-order books, stationery, and accessories from the college store, while the store admin manages stock and orders.

>  Student-facing side:
>  Home page introducing the store
>  Catalog page listing items grouped into categories (Books, Stationery, Accessories) — each item shows name, price, and stock status (In Stock / Low Stock / Sold Out)
>  Search bar to find items by name
>  Cart page — add/remove items, see quantities and a running total
>  Checkout — place the order with a pickup time slot; no login, track the student by session
>  Optional coupon code field at checkout that applies a discount if valid
>  "My Orders" page showing the current session's order history and status


Admin side (separate section, not visible to students):
>  View all orders with their status (Pending / Packed / Delivered) and update it
>  See total orders and total revenue
>  See the top-selling items
>  Mark an item sold out or update its stock count

Expected behaviour:
One consistent layout and navigation across all pages
Sensible messages for edge cases — empty cart, no search results, out-of-stock item, invalid coupon